# `interface` and `protocol` declare a trait as `trait` does (wiki/trait.md; card trait-alias)
'trait Shape { area() }; class Sq { side: int; area() := side * side }; s: Shape = Sq(3); s.area()'	9
'interface Shape { area() }; class Sq { side: int; area() := side * side }; s: Shape = Sq(3); s.area()'	9
'protocol Shape { area() }; class Sq { side: int; area() := side * side }; s: Shape = Sq(3); s.area()'	9
